      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient with acute severe myocardial ischaemia manifested with transient giant R waves and ST segment elevation during chest pain. This probably represents transient complete occlusion of a major coronary artery, the left anterior descending in this case. Myocardial infarction was prevented by aggressive medical and surgical management."},
